# Bundled Books: shelf, then the shared reader for an EPUB.
# The simulator draws no runtime Back, so Markdown is driven from a
# fresh start in drive-markdown.kobo rather than after a tap Back.
expect Books
expect The Open Sea
expect Notes on a Rainy
expect Timetable
expect-missing epub
expect-missing md
shot books-shelf
tap The Open Sea
wait-for harbour
expect The tide was already turning
shot books-epub
dump
